stateDiagram-v2
    state risk <<choice>>
    [*] --> Authorizing
    Authorizing --> risk
    risk --> Captured : the risk score is under 40
    risk --> ThreeDS : the risk score is 40 or over
    state ThreeDS {
        [*] --> Challenge
        Challenge --> Verified : the issuer accepts
        Challenge --> Abandoned : the shopper leaves
        Verified --> [*]
        Abandoned --> [*]
    }
    ThreeDS --> Captured : verified
    ThreeDS --> Declined : abandoned
    Captured --> [*]
    Declined --> [*]
